{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07597","headline":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 五 · 萧颖士","name":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关西一公子，年貌独青春。\n被褐来上京，翳然声未振。\n中郎何爲者，倒屣惊座宾。\n词赋岂不佳，盛名亦相因。\n爲君奏此曲，此曲多苦辛。\n千载不可诬，孰言今无人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}